      }, {
        "text": "14} fill\u003d\"currentColor\" /\u003e RUN (Cloud)\n            \u003c/button\u003e\n            {offlineHexCode \u0026\u0026"
      }, {
        "text": " (\n              \u003cbutton onClick\u003d{runSimulationOffline} disabled\u003d{isRunning} className\u003d{`flex items-center justify-center"
      }, {
