      }, {
        "text": "600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white\u0027}`} title\u003d{`Run ${offlineHexName"
      }, {
        "text": "}`}\u003e\n                \u003cPlay size\u003d{14} fill\u003d\"currentColor\" /\u003e RUN (Local)\n              \u003c/button\u003e"
      }, {
        "text": "\n            )}\n            \u003cbutton onClick\u003d{stopSimulation} className\u003d\"flex items-center justify-center gap-2"
