        "text": "\n  pinMode(MOTOR_LEFT, OUTPUT);\n  pinMode(MOTOR_RIGHT, OUTPUT);\n  pin"
      }, {
        "text": "Mode(IMU_PIN, INPUT);\n  \n  Serial.println(\"IMU Test Booted!\");\n  Serial.println(\"Seeking Target"
