        "text": " 0-1023\n  int raw \u003d analogRead(IMU_PIN);\n  \n  // Map"
      }, {
        "text": " the raw ADC value back to 0 - 360 degrees\n  return (raw / 1023"
      }, {
        "text": ".0) * 360.0;\n}\n\nvoid loop() {\n  float currentHeading \u003d"
