        "text": " degrees of our target! Stop the motors.\n    digitalWrite(MOTOR_LEFT, LOW);\n    digitalWrite(MOTOR_RIGHT, LOW);"
      }, {
        "text": "\n    \n    Serial.println(\"Target Reached! Pausing...\");\n    delay(2000);"
