      "text": "\"\nSeeking Target: 90 degrees\nHeading: 0.00 deg\nHeading: 0.00 deg\nHeading: 13.02 deg\nHeading: 26.39 deg\nHeading: 32.73 deg\nHeading: 46.10 deg\nHeading: 59.12 deg\nHeading: 65.81 deg\nHeading: 79.18 deg\nHeading: 92.20 deg\nTarget Reached! Pausing...\n\"\n\nSYS_TELEMETRY Angle: 99.01",
      "role": "user",
